<title>JAPAN: Shinwa Naiko - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinwa Naiko - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.02		vs	    3.88</p>
<p> Operating	  221    mln	  vs	  281    mln</p>
<p> Current	     94    mln	  vs	   72    mln</p>
<p> Net	     loss 1    mln	  vs	 prft 36 mln</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 0.13 yen	  vs     prft 3.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Shinwa Naiko Kaiun Kaisha Ltd is a freight transportation firm.</p>
